": "2117008072983896064", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:46:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117010419693064680"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 12, "id": "44196397", "start": 3, "username": "elonmusk"}]}, "id": "2117010419693064680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hi @elonmusk \n\nI have a technology concept called Smart Brain Pin — a non-invasive, two-way brain-computer interface connecting human cognition, AI, animal communication, and ecosystem intelligence.\n\nI have the design and development blueprint.\nCould we connect? 🚀", "url": "https://x.com/Nothingsfv/status/2117010419693064680"}, {"author_id": "1394570830294654977", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:04:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116878926068744258"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TZRDegOGZb", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CNSpaceflight/status/2116878926068744258/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116844960679174144", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/TZRDegOGZb"}, {"display_url": "x.com/CNSpaceflight/…", "end": 315, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/CNSpaceflight/status/2114602769185423755", "start": 292, "url": "https://t.co/S028qBCW9m"}]}, "id": "2116878926068744258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 4396, "like_count": 88, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 20}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114602769185423755", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Space physiology on Shenzhou-23\n\nAstronaut LAI JiaYing wears an EEG (electroencephalogram) headset to perform a weak stimulation brain-computer interface test.\n\nMeanwhile, blood samples from the crew have been drawn and centrifuged for medical checks and experiments. https://t.co/TZRDegOGZb https://t.co/S028qBCW9m", "url": "https://x.com/CNSpaceflight/status/2116878926068744258"}, {"author_id": "243066423", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:31:15.000Z", "edit_his